# x.com, twitter.com, t.co, and twimg.com block or login-wall anonymous
# checkers, including GitHub-hosted runners (403). scripts/check_x_posts.py
# verifies each status on every pull request and on the weekly run:
# handle, UTC date, and that the stored prompt is text on the post.
# Media URLs were checked once by hand on 2026-10-29 (HTTP 206, no account).

^https://x\.com
^https://twitter\.com
^https://t\.co
^https://video\.twimg\.com
^https://pbs\.twimg\.com
